        "In the year 2020, the Swedish National Agency for Education implemented a change and transitioned from reporting expenditure per academic year to calendar year. Statistics for the year 2020 and onward is presented in the table [Expenditure on Swedish schools abroad](https://www.statistikdatabasen.scb.se/pxweb/eng/ssd/START__UF__UF0514/UtbKostUtlandAr). This represents break in time series break and expenditure for the autumn semester of 2019 are not included in any of the tables."
